      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f57725b3fd23a31258fe370d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥看见年幼参拜者纯真的愿望露出了灿烂笑容。\n从这一天起她的状态开始好转。",
      "source_fingerprint": "219ff869e210a5343ad46d3a461983b82d156513fc91ad9d21f3e156a9641842",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110707.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b755903ed0544df92409fd81",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我试着寻找绘马\n想在上面写下愿望却――",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3bd484bfcbbb4c48db0a86f0b116d02338605d8cd98b784eeac565885f323c2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110707.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b70745b206a7b3b599372ec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是不是来得不巧",
      "source_fingerprint": "074e7aae6b85376b5a43c2833f73aa844bf4da4838fe647d66f2fad940fb0709",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
